  "delivered": [
    "All five public original-EventLog discovery entrypoints are exposed independently: mine_ilp and discover_ilp_miner, plus mine_genetic, discover_genetic_miner and discover_genetic. The three aliases retain their actual public signatures; no duplicate algorithm or cached mining substitution is introduced.",
    "All 7 ILP and 12 genetic option fields retain native defaults, exact supplied-member presence, full size_t/uint64 integer tokens, finite and nonfinite binary64 values, literal NativeString selectors/boundaries and ordered duplicate causal pairs. Native limits and reached validation remain authoritative; the old convenience-route ILP cap is not copied into the exact host.",
    "The request owns full original logs, streams, typed tables or finite lazy rows and CSV/XES/gzip imports. All 10 CSV, 21 XES, 17 preparation options and five selectors remain independent. Both miners require an actual EventLog; an original non-log source receives a truthful kind error unless the caller explicitly prepares it to a log.",
    "Complete ILPMinerResult net/markings/diagnostics and GeneticMinerResult matrix/net/markings/diagnostics preserve all 3/4 stored fields, 6/9 diagnostic fields, complete nine-field Petri storage and signed WorkflowMarkings. Native entry, return, errors, each independent exporter and original/source/result artifact bytes remain inspectable without session registration.",
    "The canonical genetic result and matrix.json retain every NativeString activity byte and every ordered partition group. The older supplied-matrix converter accepts scalar JSON strings only, so handoff is explicit and restricted to its exact representable domain. Arbitrary byte labels keep complete raw downloads and a truthful unsupported-reuse message; repairing that converter remains a queued gap.",
    "The standalone and native-discovery panels provide original editors/uploads, all operations/options/import controls, request replacement/cancellation guards, complete diagnostics/results/tables/CSV/reports and exact original/artifact downloads. Prepared logs can be reused. Model and matrix handoff is explicit and retains the documented older-converter byte-domain limit. Native/API/portable/full frontend/build/live checks passed; rendered browser verification remains open."
  ],
